OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA pair of air ambulance teams
OL,7,     Frespond to a serious accident
OL,8,     Fwhere one passenger was thrown out
OL,9,     Fwhile the driver remains trapped.
OL,10,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,11,     FA man is rushed in to Majors
OL,12,     Fsuffering a collapsed lung as air
OL,13,     Fleaks into his chest cavity, a
OL,14,     Fhighly abusive patient must be
OL,15,     Frestrained, and a rough sleeper
OL,16,     Fcomes in with burnt feet.
