OL,6,     FCan Dr Emma remove some cysts from
OL,7,     Fpatient Georgia's leg without them
OL,8,     Fexploding? Dr Adil Sheraz tackles
OL,9,     Flipomas and there's an
OL,10,     Feye-watering mole for Dr Dev Shah.
